        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"from\": \"John <john@intrawebtech.com>\",\n  \"to\": [\"{{ $json.email }}\"],\n  \"subject\": \"Welcome to IntraWeb — here's what happens next\",\n  \"html\": \"<h2>Welcome to IntraWeb Technologies, {{ $json.first_name }}!</h2><p>We're excited to start building with {{ $json.company_name }}.</p><h3>What happens next:</h3><ul><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Schedule your kickoff call using the link below</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Complete the credentials intake form (separate email incoming)</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Week 1 — we map your current ops and identify the first three automations to build</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Week 2-3 — first workflows delivered and tested</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Training session so your team knows exactly how it all works</li></ul><h3>Book Your Kickoff Call</h3><p><a href='https://calendly.com/intrawebtech/kickoff' style='background:#0066cc;color:white;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;'>Schedule Kickoff Call</a></p><h3>Your Tier: {{ $json.tier }}</h3><p>Monthly Investment: ${{ $json.deal_value }}</p><hr><p>Questions? Reply to this email or text/call me directly.</p><p>John<br>IntraWeb Technologies<br>john@intrawebtech.com</p>\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fcb64001-749e-42a3-9291-557e81a6302a",
